--- Summary

+ Added a dedicated `ai/` layer for policies, prompts, skills, reports, logs, and knowledge placeholders.
+ Added read-only project scanners for structure, Prisma entities, SEO surfaces, admin/API surfaces, and risk surfaces.
+ Added `LocationPage` SEO planner for local SEO planning and gap analysis.
+ Added content draft generator for `LocationPage`, `Kitchen`, `BlogPost`, and `PortfolioCase`.
+ Added QA reviewer for draft packets with `PASS / NEEDS_REVIEW / FAIL` outcomes.
+ Added router layer to force skill selection, mode selection, and risk-aware routing.
+ Added strictly limited draft-safe writer that only writes sanitized draft artifacts under `ai/reports/writes/`.
+ Preserved hard restrictions around pricing, auth, middleware, settings, publish state, slug changes, and route-level SEO core.

