--- Policy Layer

+ Safety modes are defined in `ai/policies/modes.json`:
+ - `read_only`
+ - `draft_safe`
+ - `review_required`
+
+ Entity safety matrix is defined in `ai/policies/entities.json`:
+ - allowed first-wave entities:
+   - `LocationPage`
+   - `Kitchen`
+   - `BlogPost`
+   - `PortfolioCase`
+ - blocked high-risk entity:
+   - `PriceRule`
+
+ Forbidden and review-sensitive actions are defined in:
+ - `ai/policies/actions.json`
+ - `ai/policies/review.json`
+
+ Router policy is defined in `ai/policies/router-rules.json`.

--- Implemented Modules

+ `project-structure-scanner`
+ - scans key folders and files
+ - finds Prisma schema
+ - finds admin and metadata files
+ - writes `ai/reports/project-structure.json`
+
+ `prisma-entity-mapper`
+ - reads `artifacts/kuhni-na-zakaz/prisma/schema.prisma`
+ - extracts models and fields
+ - maps safety classes
+ - writes `ai/reports/prisma-entity-map.json`
+
+ `seo-surface-scanner`
+ - maps `app/layout.tsx`
+ - maps `app/robots.ts`
+ - maps `app/sitemap.ts`
+ - maps route-level `generateMetadata`
+ - writes `ai/reports/seo-surface-map.json`
+
+ `admin-surface-scanner`
+ - scans `app/admin/**`
+ - scans `app/kapi/admin/**`
+ - marks safe-looking, review-required, and high-risk surfaces
+ - writes `ai/reports/admin-surface-map.json`
+
+ `risk-surface-builder`
+ - merges policy-defined and scanner-detected risk surfaces
+ - writes `ai/reports/risk-surfaces.json`
+
+ `locationpage-seo-planner`
+ - reads trusted project artifacts for `LocationPage`
+ - audits local SEO coverage
+ - generates planning outputs
+ - writes:
+   - `ai/reports/locationpage-seo-audit.json`
+   - `ai/reports/locationpage-content-plans.json`
+   - `ai/reports/locationpage-gap-report.md`
+
+ `content-draft-generator`
+ - generates draft packets for:
+   - `LocationPage`
+   - `Kitchen`
+   - `BlogPost`
+   - `PortfolioCase`
+ - writes:
+   - `ai/reports/drafts/locationpage-drafts.json`
+   - `ai/reports/drafts/kitchen-drafts.json`
+   - `ai/reports/drafts/blogpost-drafts.json`
+   - `ai/reports/drafts/portfoliocase-drafts.json`
+   - `ai/reports/drafts/content-draft-summary.md`
+
+ `publication-qa-reviewer`
+ - reviews draft packets for content quality, SEO completeness, and safety
+ - emits `PASS / NEEDS_REVIEW / FAIL`
+ - writes:
+   - `ai/reports/reviews/publication-qa-review.json`
+   - `ai/reports/reviews/publication-qa-summary.md`
+
+ `draft-safe-writer`
+ - accepts:
+   - `entity`
+   - `identifier`
+   - `mode`
+   - `patchPayload`
+   - optional `currentState`
+ - enforces policy-based field filtering
+ - writes only sanitized draft state under `ai/reports/writes/state/`
+ - writes attempt packet and review packet
+ - appends JSONL logs under `ai/logs/draft-safe-writer.jsonl`

--- Router Layer

+ Router prompt is defined in `ai/prompts/router.md`.
+ Router machine rules are defined in `ai/policies/router-rules.json`.
+
+ Supported router targets:
+ - `project-structure-reader`
+ - `prisma-entity-mapper`
+ - `locationpage-seo-planner`
+ - `content-draft-generator`
+ - `entity-draft-writer`
+ - `seo-metadata-auditor`
+ - `publication-qa-reviewer`
+ - `pricing-risk-guard`
+ - `admin-route-surface-mapper`
+
+ Special cases are explicitly routed:
+ - `PriceRule` and `lib/kitchen-configurator/price.ts` -> `pricing-risk-guard`, `review_required`
+ - `auth.ts`, `middleware.ts`, `settings` -> review-only / forbidden for autonomous apply
+ - `slug`, `published`, `publishedAt`, sensitive metadata -> `review_required`
+ - route-level SEO core -> audit only unless escalated to review
+ - `LocationPage` planning -> `locationpage-seo-planner`

--- Writer Enforcement

+ Draft-safe writer only accepts mode `draft_safe`.
+ Draft-safe writer only accepts entities:
+ - `LocationPage`
+ - `Kitchen`
+ - `BlogPost`
+ - `PortfolioCase`
+
+ Writer blocks:
+ - `PriceRule`
+ - `slug`
+ - `published`
+ - `publishedAt`
+ - pricing fields
+ - sensitive metadata fields
+ - auth-related fields
+ - settings-related fields
+ - middleware-like fields
+
+ Writer outputs:
+ - sanitized draft state
+ - attempt report
+ - review packet
+ - JSONL log entry
+
+ Example request:
+ - `ai/reports/writes/examples/locationpage-safe-request.json`
+
+ Example result from current run:
+ - entity: `LocationPage`
+ - identifier: `minsk-test-draft`
+ - applied fields: `intro`, `faq`
+ - blocked fields: `published`, `seoTitle`, `slug`
+ - result: `partial`

--- QA Reviewer Outcomes

+ Current review run checked `22` draft packets.
+ Current summary:
+ - `PASS: 0`
+ - `NEEDS_REVIEW: 22`
+ - `FAIL: 0`
+
+ Common reasons:
+ - `body_too_short`
+ - `keyword_spam_signal`
+ - `slug_stays_in_review_scope`
+ - `publish_stays_in_review_scope`
+
+ This is expected for first-pass draft packets because the reviewer is designed to stop unsafe or incomplete material from being treated as apply-ready.

